  unitName: Gazolina Splash (EU)
  unitId: 720155
  unitNumber: 7089
  description: "Gazolina participated in the attack against Bloody Blink\u2019s city.
    Like the others, she received Techs as a reward. But she is now disgusted by
    Coal Cauldron\u2019s battles and bloodlust. More powerful and better able to
    protect her allies than ever before, she finds herself alone once again, wandering
    the desolate moors in search of a new adventure!"
  summonDesc: "Now that I\u2019m here, no one else will be injured."
  fusionDesc: Maximum Mana Shield!
  evoDesc: This new power will help me protect everyone.
